{"id":"0f9bb628fd6df6ce","group":"62","path":"62/62-df-first-order-arithmetic.md","title":"First Order Arithmetic Inside the L2 Signature","display":"df-first-order-arithmetic — First Order Arithmetic Inside the L2 Signature","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-df-first-order-arithmetic","aliases":["62-df-first-order-arithmetic"],"display":"df-first-order-arithmetic — First Order Arithmetic Inside the L2 Signature","depends_on":["[[62-df-L2]]","[[62-df-basic-axioms]]","[[62-df-Induction]]","[[62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definition I.2.1; Definition IX.1.4; Corollary IX.1.11","source_pages":[2,3,362,365],"source_pdf_pages":[20,21,380,383]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-df-first-order-arithmetic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-df-first-order-arithmetic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-first-order-arithmetic — First Order Arithmetic Inside the L2 Signature"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d77f54c9499e3bba\" href=\"?note=d77f54c9499e3bba\" title=\"62-df-basic-axioms\">62-df-basic-axioms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0f09dfa85ea5ca71\" href=\"?note=0f09dfa85ea5ca71\" title=\"62-df-Induction\">62-df-Induction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"eaea482f0ad24c81\" href=\"?note=eaea482f0ad24c81\" title=\"62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy\">62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definition I.2.1; Definition IX.1.4; Corollary IX.1.11"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>2</span><span>3</span><span>362</span><span>365</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20</span><span>21</span><span>380</span><span>383</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>语法见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a>，基本公理 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm Q_2\">\\(\\mathrm Q_2\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d77f54c9499e3bba\" href=\"?note=d77f54c9499e3bba\" title=\"62-df-basic-axioms\">62-df-basic-axioms</a>，归纳生成算子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ind}_{S_2}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ind}_{S_2}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0f09dfa85ea5ca71\" href=\"?note=0f09dfa85ea5ca71\" title=\"62-df-Induction\">62-df-Induction</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^0_1(S_2)\">\\(\\Sigma^0_1(S_2)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"eaea482f0ad24c81\" href=\"?note=eaea482f0ad24c81\" title=\"62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy\">62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{I}\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\mathrm{I}\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 在下式引入；所有公理通过同一签名嵌入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_2\">\\(L_2\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{At}_{L_1}\">\\(\\mathrm{At}_{L_1}\\)</span> 在 Assertion 中引入；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\">\\(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\">\\(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}arithmetic}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{At}_{L_1}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{s=t,s&lt;t:s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{S_2}\\},\\qquad G_0=\\mathrm{At}_{L_1},\\\\\nG_{k+1}&amp;\\coloneqq G_k\\cup\\{\\neg\\alpha,(\\alpha\\circ\\beta),Qn\\alpha:\\alpha,\\beta\\in G_k,n\\in V_N\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_1}&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_kG_k,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_1}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_1}\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_2}^{2},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PA}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm Q_2\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_1}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{I}\\Sigma_1&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm Q_2\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_{S_2}(\\Sigma^0_1(S_2)\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_1}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}arithmetic}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{At}_{L_1}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{s=t,s&lt;t:s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{S_2}\\},\\qquad G_0=\\mathrm{At}_{L_1},\\\\\nG_{k+1}&amp;\\coloneqq G_k\\cup\\{\\neg\\alpha,(\\alpha\\circ\\beta),Qn\\alpha:\\alpha,\\beta\\in G_k,n\\in V_N\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_1}&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_kG_k,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_1}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_1}\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_2}^{2},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PA}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm Q_2\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_1}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{I}\\Sigma_1&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm Q_2\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_{S_2}(\\Sigma^0_1(S_2)\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_1}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_1\">\\(L_1\\)</span> 只保留 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,1,+,\\cdot,&lt;,=\">\\(0,1,+,\\cdot,&lt;,=\\)</span> 与数变量；“没有集合量词”仍可有自由集合参数，因此不足以定义 Fml(L₁)。书中记作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^0_1\">\\(\\Sigma^0_1\\)</span>-PA 的系统在这里记作 IΣ₁。非空额外集合域不增加纯 L₁ 逻辑定理，故同一双类演算中的保守性比较与通常一阶比较一致。Fml(L₁) 的句法条件可递归判定：原子不允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in X\">\\(t\\in X\\)</span>，量词只允许数变量，联结词递归保留。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Definition I.2.1; Definition IX.1.4; Corollary IX.1.11；纸面页 2, 3, 362, 365；PDF 页 20, 21, 380, 383。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-L2","status":"resolved","id":"4c6d2d9f1999915f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-L2]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-basic-axioms","status":"resolved","id":"d77f54c9499e3bba","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-basic-axioms]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-Induction","status":"resolved","id":"0f09dfa85ea5ca71","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-Induction]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"eaea482f0ad24c81","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-L2","status":"resolved","id":"4c6d2d9f1999915f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"语法见 [[62-df-L2]]，基本公理 $\\mathrm Q_2$ 见 [[62-df-basic-axioms]]，归纳生成算子 $\\mathrm{Ind}_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-Induction]]，$\\Sigma^0_1(S_2)$ 见 [[62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy]]。$\\mathrm{PA}$、$\\mathrm{I}\\Sigma_1$ 在下式引入；所有公理通过同一签名嵌入 $L_2$。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-basic-axioms","status":"resolved","id":"d77f54c9499e3bba","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"语法见 [[62-df-L2]]，基本公理 $\\mathrm Q_2$ 见 [[62-df-basic-axioms]]，归纳生成算子 $\\mathrm{Ind}_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-Induction]]，$\\Sigma^0_1(S_2)$ 见 [[62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy]]。$\\mathrm{PA}$、$\\mathrm{I}\\Sigma_1$ 在下式引入；所有公理通过同一签名嵌入 $L_2$。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-Induction","status":"resolved","id":"0f09d